<topic xml:id="minimal-vm-get"
 role="concept" xml:lang="en"
 xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook" version="5.2"
 xmlns:its="http://www.w3.org/2005/11/its"
 xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude"
 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
 xmlns:trans="http://docbook.org/ns/transclusion">
  <info>
    <title>Obtaining &minvm; images</title>
    <meta name="maintainer" content="eliska.romanova@suse.com" its:translate="no"/>
    <abstract>
      <para>
        Learn how to download and identify the correct &minvm; images for your target platform
      </para>
    </abstract>
  </info>
  <para>
    Download the images from the official
    <link os="sles" xlink:href= "https://www.suse.com/download/sles/">Download</link><link os="sles4sap" xlink:href= "https://www.suse.com/download/sle-sap/">Download</link>
    page. Images have the platform in the name, based on their purpose:
  </para>
  <itemizedlist>
    <listitem>
      <para>
        <literal>Cloud</literal> for cloud platforms
      </para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>
        <literal>kvm-and-xen</literal> for &kvm; and &xen; hypervisors
        <!-- Xen needs confirmation for x86_64 in SLE 16 -->
      </para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>
        <literal>MS-HyperV</literal> for &hyperv; hypervisors
      </para>
    </listitem>
    <listitem>
      <para>
        <literal>VMware</literal> for &vmware; hypervisors
      </para>
    </listitem>
  </itemizedlist>
  <note os="sles4sap">
    <title>&sleminvm; architecture availability</title>
    <para>
      Ready-to-use &sleminvm; images are currently available for the x86_64 architecture only. The
      images for &power; are planned to be available in a future release.
    </para>
  </note>
</topic>
